      "correctAnswer": 0,
      "explanation": "You can raise a positive number to any real power (positive, negative, zero, integer, or fraction) and get a valid real result. Therefore, the domain is <b>all real numbers</b>.",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "points": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 1795857681208.9697,
      "question": "<div style='font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: 600;'>The range of <b>y = a<span style='vertical-align: super; font-size: 0.75em;'>x</span></b>, a > 0, a &ne; 1, is:</div>",
