      "question": "<div style='font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: 600;'>Simplify: <b>(625)<span style='vertical-align: super; font-size: 0.75em;'>3/8</span> &times; (5)<span style='vertical-align: super; font-size: 0.75em;'>1/2</span> &divide; 25</b></div>",
