      "question": "<div style='font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: 600;'>Solve: <b>2<span style='vertical-align: super; font-size: 0.75em;'>x</span> + 2<span style='vertical-align: super; font-size: 0.75em;'>x&minus;1</span> = 48</b></div>",
