      "question": "<div style='font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: 600;'>Solve: <b>log<span style='vertical-align: sub; font-size: 0.75em;'>4</span> x + log<span style='vertical-align: sub; font-size: 0.75em;'>x</span> 4 = 2.5</b></div>",
